---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import T from './T.astro';
---
<Section id="about" num="01" label="About" labelZh="关于" variant="dossier">
  <article class="dossier">
    <p class="dossier-code">CURIOSITY FILE / ACTIVE</p>
    <h3><T en="A short story" zh="我的故事" /></h3>
    <p class="t-en">I keep making things because apparently leaving an idea alone is not one of my skills. Some are useful, some are gloriously unnecessary, and most begin with “what if?” I like trains, games, design, AI, biology, and the strange places where they crash into each other. Somewhere along the way, curiosity accidentally turned into doing a PhD at HKUST. I still learn the same way: build it, break it, make notes, try again.</p>
    <p class="t-zh">我总忍不住把脑子里的点子做出来 —— 看来「先放着不管」并不是我的强项。有些真的有用，有些精彩得毫无必要，而大多数都始于一句「要不试试？」我喜欢火车、游戏、设计、AI、生物，也喜欢看它们在意想不到的地方撞个满怀。不知不觉，好奇心一路把我带到了香港科技大学读博。我的学习方式倒一直没变：先做出来，拆坏它，记两笔，再来一次。</p>
    <div class="chips">{profile.focus.map((focus) => <span class="chip" data-focus={focus.en}><T en={focus.en} zh={focus.zh} /></span>)}</div>
  </article>
</Section>
<style>
  .dossier {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 38px);
    border: var(--stroke);
    background: var(--paper-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
    transform-origin: center;
  }

  .dossier::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    width: 46px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ink) 0 2px, transparent 2px 5px);
    content: '';
    opacity: .72;
  }

  .dossier-code {
    margin-bottom: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);
    color: var(--muted);
    font: 500 11px/1.3 var(--font-note);
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  h3 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font: 400 clamp(32px, 6vw, 58px)/.95 var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: .01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .dossier > :global(p:not(.dossier-code)) {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .chip {
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--green-bright);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
    font: 500 11px/1.2 var(--font-note);
    letter-spacing: .02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .dossier {
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
      transform: none;
    }

    .dossier::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
